Q: How to replace client or interaction when getting a channel&#39;s id? A: <p>You can get the client using <code>member.client</code> in the <code>guildMemberAdd</code> event. Thus the following code should work inside the first <code>if</code> clause:</p>
<pre><code>if (!member.user.bot) {
        member.roles.add(roleView);
        if (member.user.id === &quot;994167928989696020&quot;) return;

        const client = member.client; // Retrieve the client from the member

        const channel = client.channels.cache.get(channelArrival);
        channel.send({embeds: [embed]});
        const channel2 = client.channels.cache.get(channelGen);
        channel2.send(`Bienvenue ${member} !`);
}
</code></pre>
<p>Hopefully this helps!</p>
